        <mxCell id="6cnbei4Q0fEMiS3Ij1ch-31" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Verifies application details and documents&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Marks entries for the green card&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Enters an entry on the mother parcel green card under the proprietorship section for title closure&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Can forward, reject or return application to applicant&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="6cnbei4Q0fEMiS3Ij1ch-24">
